<cell id="a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000004"><cell_type>markdown</cell_type>## Training
Run the full 8-phase curriculum. Checkpoints and metrics are saved to Google Drive so they survive session resets.

**Phase advancement:** any of the 8 parallel episodes must achieve 5 consecutive PASS days within a single episode. If not reached within 500 episodes, the phase advances automatically.</cell id="a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000004">
<cell id="a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000005">from gpu_rl_trading.training.train import run_training

cfg_overrides = {
    "DATA_CSV_EURUSD":        DATA_CSV_EURUSD,
    "DATE_FROM":              "2021-01-01",   # training period start
    "DATE_TO":                "2023-12-31",   # training period end
    "BATCH_SIZE_ENV":         8,              # 8 parallel episodes on GPU
    "EPISODE_BARS":           21_600,         # ~15 trading days of 1m bars
    "BATCH_SIZE_RL":          256,
    "CHECKPOINT_EVERY":       10,
    "MAX_EPISODES_PER_PHASE": 500,            # hard cap before auto-advancing
    "ADVANCE_DAYS":           5,              # consecutive PASS days within one episode to advance
    # Save to Drive so checkpoints survive session resets
    "CHECKPOINT_DIR": "/content/drive/MyDrive/gpu_rl_trading/checkpoints",
    "METRICS_DIR":    "/content/drive/MyDrive/gpu_rl_trading/metrics",
}

agent = run_training(cfg=cfg_overrides, resume=False)</cell id="a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000005">
